      "case": "happy",
      "summary": "Through the bridge: a job-control shell runs an interpreter in the foreground and a child in the background; process_info names launcher, foreground and background with PID plus start token and the shell role as undeclared. The program is stopped and relaunched: the old incarnation is process_replaced, its agent report token is refused, and the new incarnation reports with its own token.",
